<title>USA: TeleBanc Financial Corp Q4 net slips.</title>
<headline>TeleBanc Financial Corp Q4 net slips.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.51		    $0.65</p>
<p> Net			  1,200		    1,300</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.09		    $1.33</p>
<p> Net			  2,600		    2,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year includes a $1.7 million pretax charge from an assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund (SAIF).</p>
<p>At December 31, 1996, the company had total assets of $648 million and total deposits of $390.5 million.</p>
